Third-party acknowledgements (licenses compatible with MIT):

- pyclick (MIT) — Bernstein bezier + Gaussian distortion ideas
  used as reference for the bezier trajectory generator.
- ghost-cursor (ISC) — Fitts-style step estimation and overshoot correction
  ideas used as reference for step count and overshoot handling.
- bezier-mouse-js (MIT) — cubic bezier trajectory ideas used as reference.

These projects were used as algorithm references; the implementation here is
a pure-Python port with project-specific structure and naming. Their original
copyright and license notices remain with their respective projects.
